WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:03.586
How did it feel?

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:05.797
I mean, when you got your results.

00:00:05.797 --> 00:00:08.508
I think more than anything,
it felt kind of like relief.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:11.386
Fingernails is about a world
pretty similar to ours,

00:00:11.386 --> 00:00:14.514
other than the fact that there's
a new test that's been invented.

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:17.726
The device can tell you how compatible
you are with a partner.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:20.311
And so this Love Institute is born.

00:00:20.311 --> 00:00:23.857
I created the program
to make the bond of love stronger.

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.484
We're not here
to try to teach people to fall in love.

00:00:26.484 --> 00:00:27.694
That would be insane.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:30.405
We're here to try to bring them
closer together.

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:31.990
Love is the most elusive thing.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:35.410
We are all looking for love
and find something real.

00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:39.956
Anna is in a 100% tested relationship
with Ryan.

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:40.540
Everything on

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:44.294
the surface is great, but there's just
a little bit of doubt within Anna

00:00:44.419 --> 00:00:47.589
think she secretly comes to work
in the institute because she wants to try

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:50.550
and fight for something that she feels
is lacking within her relationship.

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:53.720
Hi. Hi.
I’m Amir.

00:00:53.803 --> 00:00:55.513
I'm Anna.

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:59.976
Amir is working at the Love Institute
to try and understand what love is.

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:02.312
Since the test has been invented,
it's been shown

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:04.272
that actually,
most people are not in love.

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:06.941
We've forgotten what it really is
to be focused on your partner.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:11.404
The film is dealing with such

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:15.366
massive themes
in a really thoughtful and specific way.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.410
Do you still have strong feelings for him?

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.832
You're not just dealing
with these test results.

00:01:22.832 --> 00:01:25.335
You're dealing with love
and the idea of love.

00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:29.255
We all strive for 100% tested
love relationships,

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:31.174
but the reality of it is that it's much

00:01:31.174 --> 00:01:32.092
messier than that.

